["Heroic: Molten Core"]="Героический: Molten Core",
["Heroic: Naxxramas"]="Героический: Naxxramas",
["Heroic: Onyxia's Lair (Vanilla)"]="Героический: Onyxia's Lair (классика)",
["Heroic: Ruins of Ahn'Qiraj"]="Героический: Ruins of Ahn'Qiraj",
["Heroic: Serpentshrine Cavern"]="Героический: Serpentshrine Cavern",
["Heroic: Sunwell Plateau"]="Героический: Sunwell Plateau",
